WEBVTT

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.410
Kyoka?!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:22.000
We now have the brain
that governs the Red Strings.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.920
Forgive me, Kasane.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:36.140
It seems we are welcome here.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:37.970
I don't know why, but...

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.150
...they seem to know who
Yuito and the rest of us are.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.980
As far as I can see, there isn't
anyone or anything fishy here.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:50.570
But there are many areas I can't see into.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:54.950
Tsugumi, let me know immediately
if you notice anything.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.330
You can count on me.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:59.250
You, too, Wataru.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:03.420
The system Major General Fubuki
set up for us works like a charm.

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:04.830
You be careful.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.000
Will do.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.380
<i>A crime in reality</i>

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:48.670
<i>For Heaven's sake</i>

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.590
<i>Accepts any fake</i>

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:53.010
<i>And disappears</i>

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:56.090
<i>Piling the eternity in fantasy</i>

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.640
<i>Won't take it at all</i>

00:01:57.640 --> 00:01:58.720
<i>I get sick</i>

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.640
<i>A girl looking back</i>

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.060
<i>Casts the miracle</i>

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.020
<i>Into the instant world </i>

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:10.900
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.740
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:15.820
<i>Spit the venom </i>

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:20.580
<i>I know why</i>

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:24.160
<i>I've found a game of ecstasy</i>

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.790
<i>Red Criminal gets life</i>

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.250
<i>I've never been in love</i>

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:35.090
<i>Don't know when I started</i>
<i>getting sick of this world</i>

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.680
<i>We will fly</i>

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.510
<i>Someday I won't be crying</i>

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:44.350
<i>I've been sacrificing myself</i>

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.770
<i>Not to hurt anybody</i>

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:03.280
The Moon's Secrets

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.700
Excuse me.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.120
What is this place?

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.120
You may interact with
history if you please.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.920
The Moon is watching over you.

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:15.550
Interact?

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:18.010
Who in the world with?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.760
There's nobody here but us.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:24.180
Did he mean we should read that book?

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:30.190
See anything, Tsugumi?

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.820
Nothing out of the ordinary.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:35.650
Please be careful.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.580
What is it you seek?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.670
Kyoka?!

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:52.590
What is this?
Why is there a Vision of Kyoka?

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.670
Name: Kyoka.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.920
Number of hits: 1.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.590
Retrieving data on Kyoka Eden...

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:04.010
Kyoka Eden is one of the Design Children
created by Togetsu.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.020
Design? She was created?

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:10.480
Design Children? I've heard of them.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.820
They are humans created
through genetic recombination.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:19.240
They're designed to have any appearance
and powers their creators want.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.910
This is what I found.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:23.030
It's basically as Luka said.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:27.080
But it's all theoretical and
has been deemed unfeasible.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.040
Kyoka is one of them?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.130
Kyoka Eden was designed based
on cells that were sampled from

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:36.250
the psionics researcher Dr. Hitoyo Pope.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:41.470
Dr. Pope is a neuroscience expert
and the matriarch of the Togetsu faith.

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:42.930
The same face?

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:46.720
Did that Dr. Pope you mentioned
create Kyoka?

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:52.900
No. Dr. Pope no longer lives.
She passed away some 2,000 years ago.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.770
Two thousand years ago?

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:57.900
Around the same time
New Himuka was founded.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:02.910
Do you think they have information
about New Himuka from back then?

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.820
We should check it out.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:10.040
Maybe we'll find something
the government covered up.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:13.790
What sort of country was New Himuka
when it was founded?

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:18.420
Retrieving data on the history
of New Himuka's founding...

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.930
New Himuka was founded 2,020 years ago

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:25.180
by the People of the Ark.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.850
The People of the Ark? What's that?

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:31.810
It is the group of immigrants
who came down from the Moon.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:34.020
From the moon?

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:38.940
Correct. In primeval days,
humankind flourished upon the earth.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.900
However, 3,000 years ago,

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:46.990
a change in the earth's orbit resulted
in an environmental cataclysm,

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:50.700
and the planet's population
drastically declined.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.660
To preserve the species,

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.750
the entire human race emigrated
to the Moon and built a city.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:00.630
The effort to improve the earth's
environment commenced.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.800
What's she talking about?

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:08.310
The thousand-year project improved
the environment to the point

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:10.350
where the Moon's government

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:14.390
could dispatch a group
of emigrants to the earth.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:18.110
They were known as the People of the Ark.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.190
It doesn't make any sense.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:25.910
Humankind left earth for
the moon and then came back?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:27.660
I never heard of that.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.330
Immigrants from the moon?

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:34.500
So then only a select number
of people were dispatched to earth?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.330
Correct.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.590
So there are still people on the moon?

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:43.050
It is not possible to answer that
with any certainty.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:44.420
Why not?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:49.300
At present, all contact with
the Moon's government is blocked.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:53.020
Blocked? Oh, you must mean
the Extinction Belt.

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:56.730
Correct. Due to the effects
of the Extinction Belt,

00:06:56.730 --> 00:07:01.440
the situation on the Moon
is currently unknown.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.530
Wait a second.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:08.990
How did that immigrant group descend
to earth if the Extinction Belt was there?

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:13.160
At the time, the Extinction Belt
did not yet exist.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:18.000
So you're saying it appeared
sometime after they came to earth?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.130
Yes, that is correct.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:25.970
Our history says the Extinction Belt
was caused by the Spring of Extinction.

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:29.470
That was around the time
of the nation's founding.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:33.220
The Others appeared along
with the Extinction Belt?

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.310
No.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:40.480
The Others suddenly began appearing
sometime after the Extinction Belt did.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.070
What? It wasn't at the same time?

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:46.400
After all, Others are spawned
by the Extinction Belt.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.700
What do you think?

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.660
It's hard to believe.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.540
The Others...

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.670
What exactly are they?

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:03.500
The information you seek
is not available here.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.840
Access to BABE is required.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.260
"BABE"?

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:12.470
Maybe it means there is
another system like this.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:20.560
We obtained info that isn't available
in Suoh or Seiran, but...

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:24.940
I gave up trying to figure out
what she was saying.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.030
It sounded utterly fantastical,

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:31.660
like the fairy tales
passed down in Togetsu.

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:35.120
Maybe it's from the Togetsu
faith's scripture?

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:38.460
If an immigrant group
founded New Himuka...

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:44.420
Wait. Does that mean our founder,
Yakumo Sumeragi, came from the moon?

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.170
If what this Vision is saying is true,

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.640
Yuito and everyone born on earth

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:54.760
are the descendants of immigrants
from the moon.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.140
That's impossible.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.720
I agree.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.440
Let's ask something else.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.480
What can you tell us about the Kunad Gate?

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.480
Retrieving data on the Kunad Gate...

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:11.070
The Kunad Gate is a quasi-black hole
that appeared in the sky

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.110
above the Kunad Highway.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.990
It is a gravitational anomaly
that continues to grow,

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:21.210
and in the near future,
it is forecast to engulf the earth.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:26.340
Furthermore, the effects of
Yuito Sumeragi's psionic power

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:30.300
have been linked to the
Kunad Gate's growth.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:34.930
The earth's destruction
can no longer be averted.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:37.180
Why is she talking about Yuito?!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.230
However, you have nothing to fear.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:48.150
You will all be saved if you
but believe in the Togetsu faith.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.990
The Moon is watching over you.

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:56.780
Wait! Why did you say that
about my psionic power?!

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:00.870
Is there a connection between
the Kunad Gate and me?!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.710
The Kunad Gate should be of no concern.

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:10.130
It is but remaking the universe to
usher in the future as it should be.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:14.380
The souls of those who perish
shall be with Mother Moon.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:32.610
Yuito, don't worry about what she said.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:37.120
That hole <i>is </i>pulling in
everything around it.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:41.290
It will swallow up the earth
once it gets big enough?

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.330
It's risky to accept
that story at face value.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.330
Yes, it could be some sort of trap.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.340
We must not let them deceive us.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:51.460
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:54.170
So? What now?

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:58.050
That BABE system the Vision
mentioned has piqued my interest.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:03.600
It said we must access BABE
if we want to ask about the Others.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:09.690
So, you seek the knowledge of BABE.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.400
Oh, um...

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.650
What exactly is BABE?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.950
It is the city computer
that controls Togetsu.

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:21.450
So it's like Suoh's Arahabaki?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.700
Togetsu has something like that?

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:27.580
I shall take you there.
This way, if you please.

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:41.300
Kasane! Please respond!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.600
Arashi! Kagero!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:47.190
Kyoka really went and did it.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.060
Please! Kyoka!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.360
Shiden! Do you read me?!

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:54.320
Come on! Why won't anyone answer me?!

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.460
I'll be right back.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:12.500
I won't let them obliterate our time
together as if it never existed.

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:37.820
The two brains that govern
the Red Strings are here.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:41.360
Our dearest wish shall soon be fulfilled.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.220
Hmm?

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:04.850
You're not coming, Shiden?

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:08.020
Kasane has yet to make up her mind.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:09.180
Same as us.

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:12.230
Thank you.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.740
It is all to right this
universe gone wrong.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:36.590
I just want to borrow
your terminal for a moment.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:42.220
Yuito? Tsugumi?

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:51.350
Kasane? Kasane?

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:55.020
Who's calling me?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:14:00.280
Kasane, congratulations.
You've finally awakened.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.530
Kasane.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.780
Kasane. Here, look.

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:17.840
It's a puppy. It's little, just like you.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:21.840
It's barking. Can you hear it?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.430
A puppy?

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:26.760
It seems familiar. But why?

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:30.430
I know this person.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:52.330
They killed it. Yes, I remember now.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:57.500
They killed my precious friend
before my eyes.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:02.460
No variation in her values,
and no psionic powers triggered.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:05.630
It seems the shock of having
a cherished pet killed is insufficient.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.220
Enough, already!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:12.180
You're trying to psychologically
scar a child, my Kasane!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:16.520
Do you really believe that is
what's best for the future?!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:20.650
The child is one of the Design Children
created for the future.

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:23.650
She is not a failure like you.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:28.660
To remake this universe gone wrong
and usher in the future as it should be,

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:31.280
we need access to the Red Strings.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:34.660
Remake the universe...

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.120
My mother.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:42.050
She was warm, gentle,
and always there to protect me.

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:44.510
I had forgotten.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:46.970
Who cares about remaking the universe?

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:49.010
It's fine as it is!

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:52.680
No, what is this feeling?

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.640
I don't want to remember.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.770
Her failed education has had
serious repercussions.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:01.770
We tried a motherly type, but...

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.900
Yes, we did. But enough is enough.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.490
We'll use this next.

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:08.990
Now I remember.

00:16:08.990 --> 00:16:11.160
I see.

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:13.410
I thought you people might...

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.290
These people...

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.500
...took my mother.

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:27.760
Kasane, forgive me.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:31.970
May your future be bright.

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:36.600
That's right.

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:42.730
That's the day I lost the woman
who raised me, my mother.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:46.900
I'm a psionics user created by technology.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.950
This power, the Red Strings...

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.030
Where am I?

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:04.210
Memories of a past forgotten...

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.460
I...

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.550
Kasane.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:13.010
You're trying to psychologically scar
a child, my Kasane!

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:15.720
Mother.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.930
"No Connection"

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:28.070
Damn it!

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:30.320
Just give up already, Shiden.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:30.950
What?!

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:34.320
You're disturbing my nap. It's annoying.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:37.410
How can you sleep at a time like this?!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.450
What's the point in panicking?

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.500
You gotta rest when you get a chance.

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.340
Why don't you take a nap, too?

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:01.810
Sleep quieter!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:03.190
Huh?!

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:16.700
Kyoka... You, too, are...

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:26.670
Here is some new attire for you,
Sister Kasane.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.550
What happened?

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:31.130
Go find out.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:38.310
Relax, it's me.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:39.810
Kagero?!

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:43.560
The prince has come to save
the damsel in distress.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:47.020
No sucker punches or anything, okay?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:51.610
You abandoned us
right before we entered Togetsu.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.030
Maybe you, too, are--

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:55.530
Working with Kyoka?

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.740
Then why would I come help you?

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.540
Try using that brain of yours.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:05.870
I did tell you that you'd
regret coming to Togetsu.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.710
Let's save the talk for later.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:11.670
Togetsu is bad news. It's way worse
than when I lived here.

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:15.590
Oh, and newsflash,
Yuito and his platoon are here, too.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:18.140
Yuito?! This is bad!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:20.970
Togetsu is after my Red Strings.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.810
And Yuito likely has the same power, so...

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.270
I get your drift.

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:29.060
I guess we'll have to save them, too.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:30.690
Time's a-wastin'.

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:40.080
Sister Kasane is gone.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.330
Kasane has disappeared?

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:49.130
A reunion with my fellow countrymen
doesn't sound all that fun.

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:51.630
All right, catch you later.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:53.840
Hey, wait!

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:55.260
Kagero.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:07.440
Kasane! Kagero!

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:09.770
I'm so glad you're okay!

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.980
Haruka, where are Arashi and the rest?

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:15.280
I don't know. I can't get through to them.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:18.030
Any idea where they might be held?

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.740
Unfortunately not.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:29.790
But I know where Yuito
and company are headed.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:35.380
We are here, Brother Yuito.

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:39.930
BABE shall answer
all the questions you might have.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:48.020
You wish to know whether what you
have heard is the truth, do you not?

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:53.230
Speak with BABE, and your doubts
shall be reborn as convictions.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:56.610
Please, ask your questions.

00:20:56.610 --> 00:21:01.070
The Moon is watching over you.

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:25.510
This doesn't seem right,
no matter how you slice it.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:29.810
Letting outsiders access a system
that's on the same level as Arahabaki

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:32.150
would normally be unthinkable.

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:35.690
I also wonder why such
a small religious order

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:38.740
would need a computer like Arahabaki.

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:42.200
Wataru? Wataru, do you read me?

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:46.280
It's no use. They're blocking Psynet.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:51.330
Let's get the information we need
and get out of here as fast as we can.

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.830
Right.

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:05.300
Huh? There's no Vision
to help us this time?

00:22:07.810 --> 00:22:09.140
What the--?!

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:13.190
I know this feeling.

00:22:13.190 --> 00:22:16.650
It feels like being connected to SAS!

00:22:16.650 --> 00:22:18.110
Yuito?

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:22.530
Oh, no.

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:24.110
I can't...

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:25.740
I can't move!

00:24:09.420 --> 00:24:12.010
The Design Children
